   "locked": false,
   "text": "hold anything for binwalk to find. It looks for\nfiles hidden inside files; in the photo it\nfinds only the photo itself.",
   "originalText": "hold anything for binwalk to find. It looks for\nfiles hidden inside files; in the photo it\nfinds only the photo itself.",
